            <div class="column half" id="service_image_3">
                <a href="https://earthserve.clicksitepages.com/earthserve" title="Generate a photorealistic image of several advanced recycling machines, clearly demonstrating their efficiency and potential impact. The lighting should be well-balanced, highlighting the clean lines of the machines and showcasing their technological capabilities."><img src="./emeke_files/generate_a_photorealistic_imag_237b344cb86dd4bf284e02e9b0d2fd01.png" style="width: 100%; height: auto;" alt="Generate a photorealistic image of several advanced recycling machines, clearly demonstrating their efficiency and potential impact. The lighting should be well-balanced, highlighting the clean lines of the machines and showcasing their technological capabilities." aria-label="Generate a photorealistic image of several advanced recycling machines, clearly demonstrating their efficiency and potential impact. The lighting should be well-balanced, highlighting the clean lines of the machines and showcasing their technological capabilities." data-img-id="service_image_3"></a>
